	(text_box "- First version of the PCB\n- Power stage for supply voltages up to 30V\n- Two CAN channels for external and internal comunications\n- One analog input for precise hall current sensor\n- Control for up to 3 power relays\n- isoSPI communications for the CMUs\n- SDC state control for Formula Student rules\n- Dedicated GPIO for precharge button"
